  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Safety Preparatory</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Food Safety Preparatory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Sverige st&#xF6;djer Georgiens m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningar f&#xF6;r EU-n&#xE4;rmandet. En viktig del i EU-n&#xE4;rmandet &#xE4;r de &#xE5;taganden som kom med undertecknandet av associeringsavtalet (AA) och det f&#xF6;rdjupade handelsavtalet (DCFTA). En av de viktigaste fr&#xE5;gorna i implementeringen av DCFTA &#xE4;r att uppfylla EU kraven f&#xF6;r livsmedelss&#xE4;kerhet.

Georgien beg&#xE4;r st&#xF6;d av jordbruksverket f&#xF6;r att bygga upp kapacitet p&#xE5; georgiska Livsmedelsverket. Sverige bidrog till detta under 2012-2015. D&#xE5; detta &#xE4;r ett genomgripande och tidskr&#xE4;vande omr&#xE5;de omfattar st&#xF6;det en f&#xF6;rberedande fas f&#xF6;r det fortsatta arbetet inom omr&#xE5;det, med eller utan st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida. Insatsen kommer att p&#xE5;g&#xE5; i sex m&#xE5;nader med en volym p&#xE5; 4 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden supports Georgia&#xB4;s efforts towards EU integration where a milestone is fulfilment of Georgia&#xB4;s obligations it took while signing the Association Agreement and Deep and Comprehensive Free Trade Agreement (DCFTA) with EU. One of the key issues in the implementation of the DCFTA is to harmonise and reach EU required standards in the area of food safety. 

In this context Georgia requested to have support in institutional building of the National Food Agency of Georgia from Swedish Board of Agriculture. Sweden provided that support in 2012-2015. However institutional building in such a complicated area as food safety takes much more time. The intervention has a preparatory nature for possible intervention for the phase two of the support. The intervention will last for six months with a volume of 4 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
